www.cygwin.com
\end_layout

\end_inset

) environment.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The R statistical package is used by Mega2’s Hardy-Weinberg equilibrium
 estimation options, as well as for plotting non-parametric linkage and
 variance-components LOD scores from the output of Merlin, LOD scores of
 Allegro and non-parametric linkage P-values from SimWalk2, as well as the
 Merlin/Simwalk2 combined analysis.
\end_layout

