\begin_layout Standard
To use the HWE options, you need to obtain and install separately the R
 "genetics" library which provides functions to perform population-genetics
 related analyses.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The genetics package requires these other packages: 
\end_layout

\begin_layout LyX-Code
combinat, gdata, gtools, MASS, mvtnorm
\end_layout

\begin_layout Paragraph
The nplplot R package
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
To use the plotting option, you need the "nplplot" R library, also distributed
 from CRAN.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
To install these packages, open up R, go to the "Package manager" menu item,
 and use the "install from the web" option.
 To load in these libraries, you can again use the package manager menu.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Or alternatively at the command line, start up R, and then issue the R command:
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout LyX-Code
install.packages(c("genetics", "nplplot"), dependencies=T) 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
You should be able to see the above libraries in the list of installed libraries.
 
\end_layout

