\begin_layout Standard
Each line that selects an input file indicates the type of file, the format
 of the file (here Mega2), the prefix (when prepended to the suffix) [ or
 the suffix (when appended to a stem)] and whether the file is required
 or optional.
 Whether the file type is embedded in the suffix or prefix depends on the
 convention used for the particular input class.
 Additional menu lines are used to set operational parameters.
\end_layout

