\begin_layout Paragraph
Re-using old Merlin analysis results with the new Rmerlin.pl
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
You can manually change the Rmerlin.*.sh scripts by replacing the arguments
 to the Rmerlin.pl command.
 The arguments following the -c switch need to be changed as follows: 
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

 -c 2,1 or -c 1,2 need to be changed to -c All,Pairs or -cPairs,All respectively.
 
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

 -c1 needs to be replaced by -cPairs or -cAll, depending on what the analysis
 was.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Run Mega2 to re-generate the scripts.
 Then, being careful not to run the merlin.*.sh scripts simply re-run the
 Rmerlin.*.sh scripts.
\end_layout

