\begin_layout Subsection
MEGA2.KEYS 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This file contains a list of input and output pedigree and person identifiers.
 It relates each input pedigree record to its corresponding output pedigree
 record.
 Since, several of the output formats within Mega2 require reordering individual
s, or re-assigning pedigree and person IDs, it is difficult for the user
 to match up the output against the input.
 Therefore, it was felt necessary to create a mapping between input and
 output pedigree data.
 From the key file, the user can identify loops that were broken up or re-connec
ted, or which nuclear pedigrees were created from an extended pedigree.
 In the case of PAP, for instance, where individuals are assigned completely
 new IDs, the key file should help greatly.
 
