\begin_layout Standard
This parameter is for any VCF file format.
 It is used to specify a subset of the command line options supported by
 the 'vcftools' program.
 These are command line options are (See 
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
name "VCFtools Options"
target "http://vcftools.sourceforge.net/options.html"

\end_inset

) the: Site Filtering Options, the Individual Filters, and the Genotype
