 item.
 Once it is set it is retained when the user logs out and in again.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Eigenstrat was designed for the correction of trait values based on ancestry
 (population stratification).
 This implies that you need to specify a trait to produce a pedigree file.
 If no trait is provided, then Mega2 will exit with an error message stating
 that a trait must be provided.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Please note that if you wish to run the 'ploteig' program, you will need
 to install 'gnuplot' (home page is http://www.gnuplot.info).
