\begin_layout Subsection
Changes from Version 4.5.4 to Version 4.5.5 (Released June 15th, 2012) 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Enhancement: Mega2 now accepts PLINK binary PED input files.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Enhancement: Mega2 now accepts PLINK PED input files.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Enhancement: Mega2 now handles multiple genetic and/or physical maps in
 the MAP file.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Enhancement: Mega2 now generates PLINK output files which may contain both
 a genetic and physical map.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Enhancement: Selecting maps and outputting maps for analysis is more general
 and robust.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Enhancement: Mega2 now uses much less storage to represent alleles and no
 longer copies allele sets.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Bug-fix: Frequency calculations were incorrect for microsatellite alleles
 with more than 9 allele values.
