\begin_layout Itemize
Bug-fix: The *.keys mapping file has been reformatted.
 And IDs have been made consistent between linkage input and annotated input.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Bug-fix: In general, code in critical loops or using large memory allocations
 has been recoded for efficiency.
\end_layout

