Bugs in Mega2 4 R5.1
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Merlin plots contained an extra straight line when the steps option is selected.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
For X-linked and Y-linked data, homozygous genotypes were mistakenly flagged
 as being heterozygous and vice versa, and always labeled as X-chromosome
